// Tchaikovsky Op.39-5: the bars where the Schirmer scan's truth (truth/, p1) differs from Mutopia's
// (truth-mutopia/, p2), written out from the truths' events. Absolute octaves: c' = C4. Both staves are in
// the treble clef. Bar 43 up: the scan opens with <a d'>8; every other bar: r8 r4 for r4.
title "tchaikovsky39-5 scan"

time 2/4
key d major

section B01_down {
  p1 { octave absolute <d' fis'>8 r8 r4 }
  p2 { octave absolute <d' fis'>8 r4. }
}

section B03_down {
  p1 { octave absolute <d' fis'>8 r8 r4 }
  p2 { octave absolute <d' fis'>8 r4. }
}

